  "name": "o1js",
  "description": "A comprehensive TypeScript framework for authoring zero-knowledge smart contracts (zkApps) and recursive ZK-SNARK circuits targeting the Mina Protocol. It exposes a domain-specific language for provable computation, leveraging the Kimchi proof system and Pickles recursion layer via WASM-compiled OCaml bindings. The toolkit includes high-level abstractions for cryptographic primitives, state-transition logic, and sophisticated gadgets for foreign field arithmetic and elliptic curve operations.",
